<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Staples started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Staples started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Staples Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $27 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Staples to earn $0.85 a share in 1997 and $1.10 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Staples gained 5/8 to 22-1/4.</p>
</text>
